{"id":"a21d838aabbea854","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nw-generator.md","title":"Nisan–Wigderson生成器","display":"df-nw-generator — Nisan–Wigderson生成器","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-nw-generator","aliases":["28-df-nw-generator"],"display":"df-nw-generator — Nisan–Wigderson生成器","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.12","source_printed_pages":"410","source_pdf_pages":"436","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nw-generator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nw-generator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nw-generator — Nisan–Wigderson生成器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"410"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"436"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m\">\\(\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|I_j|=n\">\\(|I_j|=n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma\">\\(f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=(z_1,\\ldots,z_\\ell)\\in\\Sigma^\\ell\">\\(z=(z_1,\\ldots,z_\\ell)\\in\\Sigma^\\ell\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq[\\ell]\">\\(I\\subseteq[\\ell]\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i_1,\\ldots,i_{|I|})\">\\((i_1,\\ldots,i_{|I|})\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的唯一严格递增枚举。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{res}_I(z)\\coloneqq(z_{i_1},\\ldots,z_{i_{|I|}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{res}_I(z)\\coloneqq(z_{i_1},\\ldots,z_{i_{|I|}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m,\\qquad\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}(z)\\coloneqq\\bigl(f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_1}(z)),\\ldots,f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_m}(z))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m,\\qquad\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}(z)\\coloneqq\\bigl(f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_1}(z)),\\ldots,f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_m}(z))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 20.12。递增枚举使集合限制成为有顺序的输入串，避免只给集合而无法确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的各坐标。仅均匀集合大小就足以定义生成器；小交集和平均困难性用于证明欺骗性，未偷偷并入其定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\mathcal P([\\ell])^m","display":false},{"tex":"|I_j|=n","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"z=(z_1,\\ldots,z_\\ell)\\in\\Sigma^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq[\\ell]","display":false},{"tex":"(i_1,\\ldots,i_{|I|})","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{res}_I(z)\\coloneqq(z_{i_1},\\ldots,z_{i_{|I|}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m,\\qquad\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}(z)\\coloneqq\\bigl(f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_1}(z)),\\ldots,f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_m}(z))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1465,"backlinks":[{"id":"0079cad93c58c949","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$d,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\ell>n>d$，$0<\\epsilon\\le1/2$。\n$\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}$，$f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma$。设计和生成器见 [[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]；测试类和欺骗谓词见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}